{
 "_about": [
  "Shared vectors for the schedule engine on the days the clocks change. Read by",
  "Nostalgex/NostalgexTests/ScheduleDSTGoldenTests.swift and scripts/nostalgex-schedule-dst-smoke.mjs",
  "(npm run test:schedule-dst). Both must pass every case.",
  "Times are unix seconds. start and nextStart are the zone's real local midnights from the IANA",
  "time zone database (the node test checks them against Intl). Where midnight is skipped",
  "(America/Santiago 2026-09-06) the day starts at 1 AM.",
  "days: every instant in `at` is on `date`; the engine must give that day's start, the next day's",
  "start and the previous day's key. fill: packing the `small` pool (shorter than a day, so it",
  "ends on filler) from an empty history must cover start to nextStart with no hole and no",
  "overrun. yesterday: after packing `previous`, packing `date` with the `big` pool (about 115 h)",
  "must air nothing `previous` aired, since unplayed-first never runs out.",
  "Controls with no daylight saving (Phoenix, Kolkata, UTC) run on the US and EU change dates."
